Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:00.82,temp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}不輸給冬天的寒冷\N充滿活力的少女們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勉強safe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織她們還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微有點堵車
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為我是最後一個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織她們說有工作所以來不了了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誒？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要全員集合有點困難呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這才新年演唱會全員練習的第一天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法  我們自己先練習一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距離演唱會也沒多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…其實
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:03.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也會在中途離開…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誒～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  現在正在調整日程表
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  有勞您了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好  這裡是765事務所
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝您一直以來的大力支持
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:04:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉  那幾天行程都安排滿了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  會將您的意思傳達給高木的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今後也請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了  小鳥小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香  之後還有什麼安排嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不過不回一下事務所
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就沒有一天結束的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能回來我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一早還有雜誌的取材吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午還有電視的拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不要勉強  直接回家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鳥小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？  什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天除了我還有人來過事務所嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有春香一個人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過日程表這麼緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也難怪大家了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來  製作人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香你來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:43.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情況怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  今天一次都沒摔倒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺厲害的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直是奇跡呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:02.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼作為獎勵  給你看件好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:05.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是新年演唱會的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛印好的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  大家都很可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是我的自信之作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟是新年第一場演唱會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要成功
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然現在大家真的很忙碌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日程表也那個樣子  很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是大家齊心協力的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會是一場非常棒的演唱會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧  春香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  大家一起加油吧  製作人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  大家團結哦  團結
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集合大家的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓這次演唱會成功哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為此大家必須配合好時間一起練習哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然離正式演出沒多少時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  天海小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以談一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會佔用多少時間的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  唯獨今天實在不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水瀨小姐和我那霸小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為上一份工作實在無法抽身了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亞美她們也是  拍攝還沒結束的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我替她們向春香說聲抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}春香  非常抱歉的說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}飛機誤點了  現在在羽田的說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希看來也不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然要全員一起練習很難呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明去年全員一起練習了很久的說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就以這裡的成員多多練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把今天的錄影拿給那些不能來的人看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我去借攝影機
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓小姐  麻煩幫我壓一下腰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  要好好熱一下身呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:08:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1  2  3  4
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天起得很早吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…咦  為什麼千早會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽音無小姐說了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,定期廣播的錄音  提前到早上了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然今天的練習就來不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作人員說如果是這樣的話  就答應了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千早？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去拜託製作人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫我把明天開始的國外錄音延後一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:56.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不能認同這種狀態下的演唱會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:09:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行呀  千早
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須得去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人先生說了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次的國外錄音將會影響到千早今後的發展
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以也做足了準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:23.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家心裡也都想練習的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不過新年演唱會那天必須回來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然會有點寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:10:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有個提議
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下一次全員練習之前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起工作的同事也開始小人數的練習如何
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一定一定會更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是搞什麼嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊窮酸的兩位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來沒這麼快結束呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩個人開始先練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  春春  已經沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明天的全員練習一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.89,0:11:55.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我是天海
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:12:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香  今天的全員練習只能中止了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在搞不定大家的行程
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  歡迎回來  春香
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  製作人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哦  雖然是在電話談事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不  那個不管怎樣都要把客人和偶像的熱情放在第一位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是屬於每一個人的765事務的演唱會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香  昨天真是對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在去工作室的路上又被叫回去了  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說了沒關係了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個昨天在電話裡聽你說了好多遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這個  離正式開場還有時間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和雪步三人一起來做演唱會的練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香  還是先以今天的直播為重點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Little  Match  Girl是首次披露的新歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是現場直播  不可以失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪步也在努力承受著主唱的壓力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也好好努力吧  在這個瞬間上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香  我這次沒有失敗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好厲害啊  雪步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪步  太帥了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  這週也到結束的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週再見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:51.15,temp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}好  直播嗎Sunday！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:51.15,temp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}本週也到結束的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:51.15,temp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}下週再見  1  2！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  1  2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直播嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sunday！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  OK
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天有點過火啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身子好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希  不快點的話就趕不上了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  春香
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天好像也不能去練習了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要好好看台詞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都留下來稍微等會  有事要說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腰斬？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是收視率的問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  收視率很好的哦  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也想繼續的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實是其它節目投訴  叫我們不要把整個週日都霸佔下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是受過照顧的節目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也想辦法通融過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是個很有趣的節目的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有始必有終
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦  總之好好加油到最後吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  要歡樂有趣到最終回啊  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織  路上一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎  春香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給  音樂劇的行程表
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,排演是明天的20點開始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那個時間是大家一起練習的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個工作對春香和美希來說會是非常重要的經驗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是「和演唱會比哪個重要」的問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論多麼的冷  我還會繼續夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的夢想多如繁星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所追求的是  像那太陽一樣光輝燦爛  熊熊燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天海  換你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了  我可是打算從你們兩個中選主角出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之拿出你們的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展現你們的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個角色上展現自己的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息時間是10分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和傳聞一樣是個很嚴格的舞台導演呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  但是美希覺得沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和美希一起真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是我一個人的話大概就消沉了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道誰會成為主角
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希絕對要演主角
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想這是honey給我的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓honey看成為主角的我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:31.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想和「一起加油」是不一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人？  今天還沒看見他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是跟著誰去工作現場了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼急事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我在的時候回來的話  要讓他打電話給你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是什麼大事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了  我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要歌唱  為了那高貴的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息時間是15分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  沒什麼精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來現場慰問了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舞台如何  開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.97,0:20:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且能學習的地方很多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你昨天來事務所了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有什麼事要和我說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,honey  你來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:17.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個啊  美希很努力的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧  春香
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師的訓話結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  才不是訓話  是演出指導
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  對不起對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  美希
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.33,0:21:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到銅鑼燒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  有銅鑼燒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  已經交給工作人員了  快去吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  honey的銅鑼燒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不是蜂蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  春香
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續剛才的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春香
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事…  你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  快叫救護車
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼升降台沒升上來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我…  錯了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為我那麼任性
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.47,0:24:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會變成這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二十四話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.83,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}君が触れたから七彩ボタン
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:25.60,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}全てを恋で染めたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:29.93,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}どんなデキゴトも超えてゆける強さ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.46,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}キミがボクにくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:51.95,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}「大人になったらね」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:56.39,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}ちょっと油断してる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:59.29,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}キミの横顔をね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:03.26,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}みているのよ  まだ今でも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:07.41,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}ほらね  気付いたら？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:10.70,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}同じ  眼の高さ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:14.53,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}いつの間にか少女じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.57,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}驚くでしょ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.83,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}因為有你的餘溫  七彩鈕扣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:25.60,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}一切都染上戀愛的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:29.93,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}克服一切困難那堅強的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.46,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}也是你給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:51.95,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}「長大之後呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:56.39,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}有點大意了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:59.29,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}現在也看著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:03.26,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}你的側臉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:07.41,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}你看  發現了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:10.70,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}個子已經一樣高了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:14.53,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}不知不覺間稚氣已經褪去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.57,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}嚇了一跳吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:56.39,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When  I  look  into  your  heart
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.96,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}幼い頃の小さなページ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:03.86,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}誰もが夢見てる今も
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.04,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}大人になれず凍えた日々は
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:10.35,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}幸せそうに眠ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.71,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}何も見当たらない
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:17.86,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}白い息だけが眩しく
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:25.37,songjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}風に吹かれた服を　そっと支えて
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:56.39,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When  I  look  into  your  heart
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.96,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}年幼時那小小的一頁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:03.86,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}不管誰都依然在夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.04,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}那稚氣未脫而冷冰冰的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:10.35,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}如此幸福地沉睡著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.71,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}看不到任何東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:17.86,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}白色的氣息如此耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:25.37,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}風輕輕地吹入這衣服
